                    <div class="p-4">
                        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Sony WH-1000XM5 Headphones</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-3">Premium noise-canceling headphones with exceptional sound quality.</p>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <span class="text-lg font-bold text-accent-600">$279</span>
                                <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 line-through">$399</span>
